  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育－羽球",
    "sub_ename": "BADMINTON",
    "describe_ch": "教學設計有兩方面︰以拋球方式來練習擊球點，從基本握拍、揮拍動作說明各種基本擊球動作。配合基本步法擊球。\r\n規則講解，進而分組比賽，使學生嘹解羽球運動，提升對羽球的興趣，培養成為終身運動習慣。",
    "describe_eh": "A, The method of teaching contain two parts:\r\n1. Throw the ball to practice how to hit it, from basic grab the clap, flick the clap and explain every kind of basic hit the ball movement with the racket.\r\n2. Combined with the basic foot-work to hit the ball with the racket.\r\nB, rules instruction in detail, Then dividing into the game, making student understand the badminton Exercise, promoting to the badminton of interest, the development becomes the for life exercise as a habit.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "培養羽球運動技能及常識\n.培養互助合作之精神.養成終身運動習慣",
      "describe_en": "Train badminton technical performance and general knowledge. Train and help each other the spirit of cooperation. Form the habit of moving all the life\n"
    }
  ],
